                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/20 text-center">
                        <span class="block text-2xl font-black text-fratGold">2 Programas</span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-300 uppercase font-semibold">Disponibles</span>
