                    <li><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-fratGold mr-2"></i> Barrio Calona, Juticalpa, Olancho</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-phone-alt text-fratGold mr-2"></i> (504) 2785-0000</li>
                    <li><i class="fas fa-envelope text-fratGold mr-2"></i> contacto@lafraternidad.edu.hn</li>
                </ul>
